### Get all movies
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

### Get movie by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### Movie that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/999

###add movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Inception",
    "director": "Ridley Scott",
    "year":2010,
    "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### Invalid movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "director": "Nobody"
}

### Create a valid movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "year": 2016,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### Create an invalid movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "year": "not a number"
}

### update movie
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "New title"
}

### Partially update movie 1
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2000
}

### delete movie 
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1


### Valid movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "year": 2016,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### Invalid movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "year": "not a number"
}


### PUT with a missing genre
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception",
  "year": 2010
}

### Replace movie 1
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Matrix",
  "year": 1999,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### Reject an incomplete replacement
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Matrix"
}

### PATCH with an invalid year
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": "not a number"
}

### Get a missing movie
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/999

### Get Sci-Fi Genre
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=sci-fi

### Filter by genre and year
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=Sci-Fi&minYear=2000

### Invalid year filter
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?minYear=invalid


### Sort by year
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=year

### Sort by title
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=title

### Invalid sort
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=rating

### Check the original order
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

### Local host not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/does-not-exist


### Filter by genre and year
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=Sci-Fi&minYear=2000

### Invalid minimum year
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?minYear=invalid

### Unknown route
GET http://localhost:3000/does-not-exist